    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Break It Till You Make It! - Destruction &quot;Puzzle&quot; Platformer</strong></h2><br>Rubble is a destruction-focused physics platformer where you will <strong>run</strong> and <strong>jump</strong> through gravity zones, <strong>break</strong> down or <strong>tunnel</strong> through destructibles, <strong>slide</strong> over ice, <strong>fling</strong> yourself with catapults, <strong>carry</strong> things by hand or conveyor, and use <strong>rebuild</strong>ing shots to respawn destructible terrain!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150530/extras/7cf02ff6055d640d641b15e1e9827b9e.poster.avif?t=1753465677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150530/extras/7cf02ff6055d640d641b15e1e9827b9e.webm?t=1753465677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150530/extras/7cf02ff6055d640d641b15e1e9827b9e.mp4?t=1753465677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Elements of: Portal + Minecraft + ...Getting Over it?</h2>Rubble is set in a silly dystopian future game show (think MXC / Takeshi's Castle, etc.) where contestants are pitted against dangerous obstacle courses in a simulated physics environment. To survive, they must use the power of friendship (or respawning) and this gun they found. With each spectacular death, the announcer will read a one-line intro for the next expendable contestant to give it a try!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speedrun / Replayability Encouraged!</h2>Every level tracks your time (but never compares it on a leaderboard, <i>you can post it on Reddit if you're into that</i>)! The main menu keeps a tally of ALL your best times for every level! If you make a mistake, use the quick restart hotkeys and be back in in seconds!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player-determined Difficulty with Assist Mode and Level Skipping</h2>Frustration sucks, so Rubble offers the ability to tweak the gravity, speed, air control, and number of air-jumps to make things more approachable (or quadruple jump past the puzzle!) And if you really get stuck, after a short time you can skip any level and move on to the next (you can come back later in the level select if you want!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 levels with new mechanics every few levels!<br></li><li> Assist mode settings like slowing time, lowering gravity, and adding additional jumps!<br></li><li> Speedrun Friendly and replayable with quick restart and 'return to checkpoint' hotkeys!<br></li><li> Cool animal facts on the loading screens!<br></li><li> Voice over narration for commiserating losses and introducing new contestants!</li></ul><br><strong>( Note: This is an indie game created by a <u>solo dev</u> over several years. To quote John Mulaney: &quot;I am very small. And have no money. So you can imagine the kind of stress that I am under.&quot; )</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Break It Till You Make It! - Destruction &quot;Puzzle&quot; Platformer</strong></h2><br>Rubble is a destruction-focused physics platformer where you will <strong>run</strong> and <strong>jump</strong> through gravity zones, <strong>break</strong> down or <strong>tunnel</strong> through destructibles, <strong>slide</strong> over ice, <strong>fling</strong> yourself with catapults, <strong>carry</strong> things by hand or conveyor, and use <strong>rebuild</strong>ing shots to respawn destructible terrain!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150530/extras/7cf02ff6055d640d641b15e1e9827b9e.poster.avif?t=1753465677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150530/extras/7cf02ff6055d640d641b15e1e9827b9e.webm?t=1753465677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150530/extras/7cf02ff6055d640d641b15e1e9827b9e.mp4?t=1753465677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Elements of: Portal + Minecraft + ...Getting Over it?</h2>Rubble is set in a silly dystopian future game show (think MXC / Takeshi's Castle, etc.) where contestants are pitted against dangerous obstacle courses in a simulated physics environment. To survive, they must use the power of friendship (or respawning) and this gun they found. With each spectacular death, the announcer will read a one-line intro for the next expendable contestant to give it a try!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speedrun / Replayability Encouraged!</h2>Every level tracks your time (but never compares it on a leaderboard, <i>you can post it on Reddit if you're into that</i>)! The main menu keeps a tally of ALL your best times for every level! If you make a mistake, use the quick restart hotkeys and be back in in seconds!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player-determined Difficulty with Assist Mode and Level Skipping</h2>Frustration sucks, so Rubble offers the ability to tweak the gravity, speed, air control, and number of air-jumps to make things more approachable (or quadruple jump past the puzzle!) And if you really get stuck, after a short time you can skip any level and move on to the next (you can come back later in the level select if you want!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 levels with new mechanics every few levels!<br></li><li> Assist mode settings like slowing time, lowering gravity, and adding additional jumps!<br></li><li> Speedrun Friendly and replayable with quick restart and 'return to checkpoint' hotkeys!<br></li><li> Cool animal facts on the loading screens!<br></li><li> Voice over narration for commiserating losses and introducing new contestants!</li></ul><br><strong>( Note: This is an indie game created by a <u>solo dev</u> over several years. To quote John Mulaney: &quot;I am very small. And have no money. So you can imagine the kind of stress that I am under.&quot; )</strong>",
    "short_description": "Rubble is a first-person physics-platformer where you break and dig through levels to solve puzzles in a dystopian game show setting!",
