    "reviews": "\u201cit\u2019s more like Narbacular Drop (the indie experiment that led to Portal)\u201d<br />\r\n- Someone online called &quot;Thief&quot; (Reminder: this is a game made by 1 person, not all of Valve)<br />\r\n",
